1
00:01:19,239 --> 00:01:19,799
Hurry up.

2
00:01:20,280 --> 00:01:21,439
Gong Xi,

3
00:01:21,480 --> 00:01:22,840
you don't have to be so exaggerated.

4
00:01:23,439 --> 00:01:23,840
My son-in-law,

5
00:01:23,879 --> 00:01:24,920
if My Lord knows that

6
00:01:24,920 --> 00:01:26,280
I meet you privately behind her back,

7
00:01:26,400 --> 00:01:27,359
I will be kicked out.

8
00:01:28,000 --> 00:01:29,000
I asked you out today

9
00:01:29,280 --> 00:01:29,959
just to ask

10
00:01:30,599 --> 00:01:31,400
why your article

11
00:01:31,680 --> 00:01:33,079
ended so early?

12
00:01:34,000 --> 00:01:35,280
You two aren't together,

13
00:01:35,680 --> 00:01:36,519
I have nothing to write about,

14
00:01:36,760 --> 00:01:37,560
so I have to stop writing.

15
00:01:38,280 --> 00:01:39,280
That's a shame.

16
00:01:39,719 --> 00:01:40,799
Princess Langyue

17
00:01:40,879 --> 00:01:42,040
is still waiting for the sequel.

18
00:01:42,439 --> 00:01:43,000
Really?

19
00:01:44,000 --> 00:01:44,439
My son-in-law,

20
00:01:44,760 --> 00:01:46,439
you should find a way to get back to the Escort Agency.

21
00:01:48,480 --> 00:01:49,120
Come with me.

22
00:01:49,640 --> 00:01:49,920
Okay.

23
00:01:54,480 --> 00:01:55,680
This is my plan.

24
00:01:57,560 --> 00:01:58,959
Grandfather has received my rent.

25
00:01:59,560 --> 00:02:01,519
At least he won't oppose me.

26
00:02:02,480 --> 00:02:03,120
Uncle

27
00:02:03,599 --> 00:02:05,040
is originally my enemy.

28
00:02:05,359 --> 00:02:06,120
It's hard to deal with him.

29
00:02:07,400 --> 00:02:09,759
I don't know about brother.

30
00:02:10,439 --> 00:02:12,000
But he will oppose me with Tang Xin.

31
00:02:12,000 --> 00:02:13,000
I'll contact with Jiaojiao.

32
00:02:13,639 --> 00:02:14,360
As for you,

33
00:02:14,879 --> 00:02:15,560
I don't worry about you.

34
00:02:15,879 --> 00:02:16,360
But

35
00:02:16,680 --> 00:02:17,439
I have to

36
00:02:18,159 --> 00:02:19,240
leave Fa Cai to you.

37
00:02:20,560 --> 00:02:21,159
My son-in-law,

38
00:02:21,280 --> 00:02:22,599
you want to

39
00:02:23,400 --> 00:02:25,479
defeat them one by one?

40
00:02:36,280 --> 00:02:36,800
Uncle,

41
00:02:37,360 --> 00:02:38,439
the best Yunzhonghe.

42
00:02:38,759 --> 00:02:40,080
The dishes are ready. Enjoy yourself.

43
00:02:47,680 --> 00:02:48,120
Here.

44
00:02:48,719 --> 00:02:49,400
Uncle.

45
00:02:53,520 --> 00:02:54,240
What do you want to do?

46
00:02:54,479 --> 00:02:55,680
You didn't poison me, did you?

47
00:03:05,840 --> 00:03:06,360
Uncle

48
00:03:06,800 --> 00:03:08,319
My wish now

49
00:03:08,520 --> 00:03:09,879
is to go back to the Escort Agency.

50
00:03:12,560 --> 00:03:13,639
Su Yuejiao doesn't want you.

51
00:03:13,879 --> 00:03:16,080
Even if I eat and drink a lot,

52
00:03:16,080 --> 00:03:16,960
I can't help it.

53
00:03:16,960 --> 00:03:18,280
As long as you don't object.

54
00:03:22,680 --> 00:03:23,319
Then

55
00:03:23,560 --> 00:03:26,159
I'll invite you to drink and eat every month.

56
00:03:27,479 --> 00:03:28,800
Am I that easy to please?

57
00:03:30,240 --> 00:03:31,960
At least every half month.

58
00:03:36,240 --> 00:03:37,120
Come on.

59
00:03:37,120 --> 00:03:37,919
Come on, uncle.

60
00:03:40,840 --> 00:03:41,639
Cheers, uncle.

61
00:03:43,520 --> 00:03:44,240
Just do this.

62
00:03:47,800 --> 00:03:48,479
Do you understand?

63
00:03:49,039 --> 00:03:49,639
Go, go.

64
00:03:49,639 --> 00:03:50,719
Okay, okay.

65
00:03:55,719 --> 00:03:57,120
Look at the Su's Escort Agency.

66
00:03:57,159 --> 00:03:58,759
Now they don't even use carriages to escort.

67
00:03:58,960 --> 00:04:00,560
No wonder there are so few escorts.

68
00:04:00,719 --> 00:04:01,520
Yeah.

69
00:04:01,879 --> 00:04:04,280
I heard that Mr. Cheng reads novels during the day

70
00:04:04,280 --> 00:04:05,919
and writes chapters all night.

71
00:04:06,080 --> 00:04:08,159
It's all for the business of the agency.

72
00:04:08,159 --> 00:04:08,800
Really?

73
00:04:08,879 --> 00:04:10,800
Mr. Cheng is really working hard.

74
00:04:10,960 --> 00:04:11,599
Without him,

75
00:04:11,879 --> 00:04:13,879
Su's Escort Agency would have closed long ago.

76
00:04:13,879 --> 00:04:14,719
Yeah.

77
00:04:32,000 --> 00:04:32,560
Xin,

78
00:04:33,199 --> 00:04:33,680
give it to me.

79
00:04:36,160 --> 00:04:36,720
Xin,

80
00:04:37,199 --> 00:04:38,279
the earrings

81
00:04:38,399 --> 00:04:39,160
look great on you.

82
00:04:43,360 --> 00:04:45,040
How are Cheng Qi and Jiaojiao doing?

83
00:04:47,279 --> 00:04:48,040
It seems that

84
00:04:48,319 --> 00:04:50,120
Cheng Qi has already won over Uncle and Facha.

85
00:04:50,839 --> 00:04:51,399
Next,

86
00:04:51,600 --> 00:04:52,959
it's likely to be you and me.

87
00:04:54,000 --> 00:04:55,839
You should be wary of Cheng Qi's honeyed words.

88
00:04:56,879 --> 00:04:58,879
I only care about Jiaojiao's choice.

89
00:04:59,519 --> 00:05:00,439
But you,

90
00:05:00,639 --> 00:05:01,959
don't be blinded by Cheng Qi.

91
00:05:02,560 --> 00:05:04,360
Don't worry.

92
00:05:04,480 --> 00:05:04,920
Qi.

93
00:05:05,399 --> 00:05:07,040
Qi is a sister and wife slave.

94
00:05:07,160 --> 00:05:08,519
With Jiaojiao's attitude now,

95
00:05:08,839 --> 00:05:10,839
and Tang Xin's complaints about you,

96
00:05:10,959 --> 00:05:12,720
he won't let you go back.

97
00:05:12,839 --> 00:05:14,040
How about starting with Tang Xin?

98
00:05:14,480 --> 00:05:15,720
But he also listens to his grandfather.

99
00:05:15,720 --> 00:05:17,439
I think we should go straight to Daqi.

100
00:05:17,759 --> 00:05:18,519
Besides Tang Xin,

101
00:05:18,680 --> 00:05:20,079
what else can't he resist?

102
00:05:20,959 --> 00:05:21,759
Wood.

103
00:05:22,959 --> 00:05:23,839
Thank you all.

104
00:05:24,279 --> 00:05:25,639
I have a plan.

105
00:05:30,680 --> 00:05:31,680
Sir, this way.

106
00:05:38,079 --> 00:05:38,600
Sir,

107
00:05:39,199 --> 00:05:40,079
this wood...

108
00:05:40,079 --> 00:05:41,560
You have a good eye.

109
00:05:41,680 --> 00:05:43,839
This is the best rosewood in our shop.

110
00:05:43,839 --> 00:05:45,279
The color is light,

111
00:05:45,279 --> 00:05:46,480
the texture is loose,

112
00:05:46,480 --> 00:05:47,680
exquisite and beautiful.

113
00:05:47,680 --> 00:05:49,480
The utensils made of

114
00:05:49,480 --> 00:05:50,720
rosewood in our shop

115
00:05:50,720 --> 00:05:53,519
are all covered with a very beautiful texture.

116
00:05:53,680 --> 00:05:54,839
I know it very well.

117
00:05:55,319 --> 00:05:55,720
How much?

118
00:05:55,720 --> 00:05:56,160
It's not for sale.

119
00:06:02,319 --> 00:06:05,959
This one is made of Qinglong wood, which is unique to Langyue.

120
00:06:06,040 --> 00:06:08,839
The wood is very hard,

121
00:06:09,160 --> 00:06:11,040
suitable for carving various handicrafts.

122
00:06:11,279 --> 00:06:12,920
The wooden ware made of Qinglong wood

123
00:06:12,920 --> 00:06:14,680
has a beautiful

124
00:06:14,680 --> 00:06:16,560
satin-like gloss.

125
00:06:18,240 --> 00:06:19,399
How much is this one?

126
00:06:19,480 --> 00:06:20,160
It's not for sale.

127
00:06:22,040 --> 00:06:23,639
If you don't sell any of them,

128
00:06:23,639 --> 00:06:25,079
why are you introducing them to me?

129
00:06:25,079 --> 00:06:25,800
It's for you.

130
00:06:26,720 --> 00:06:27,319
For free?

131
00:06:29,879 --> 00:06:30,439
Why?

132
00:06:31,759 --> 00:06:33,199
Because you are a man of justice,

133
00:06:33,600 --> 00:06:36,160
and know how to save others from the water and fire.

134
00:06:36,279 --> 00:06:37,040
And you, sir,

135
00:06:37,040 --> 00:06:38,399
you don't hold grudges,

136
00:06:38,759 --> 00:06:40,959
and know how to make a marriage.

137
00:06:47,839 --> 00:06:48,600
You...

138
00:06:50,120 --> 00:06:50,920
Brother

139
00:06:51,279 --> 00:06:52,199
I was wrong.

140
00:06:52,680 --> 00:06:54,720
I'll never say anything that makes her unhappy.

141
00:06:54,839 --> 00:06:56,040
Please give me another chance.

142
00:06:56,040 --> 00:06:57,079
Let me back to the Escort Agency, okay?

143
00:06:57,079 --> 00:06:58,680
I'll be nice to her in the future.

144
00:06:59,360 --> 00:07:00,240
Brother

145
00:07:01,399 --> 00:07:02,360
Calm down.

146
00:07:03,000 --> 00:07:03,800
People would think

147
00:07:03,879 --> 00:07:05,439
I bullied you if they see you like this.

148
00:07:05,480 --> 00:07:07,079
Brother, I beg you.

149
00:07:07,079 --> 00:07:08,439
Please let me back to the Agency.

150
00:07:08,680 --> 00:07:09,959
Even if I go out earlier,

151
00:07:10,079 --> 00:07:11,720
and take more escorts,

152
00:07:11,879 --> 00:07:13,959
I'll have more time to accompany Jiao.

153
00:07:14,079 --> 00:07:15,079
Aren't you afraid of her beating you?

154
00:07:15,079 --> 00:07:16,079
It's good for her to beat me.

155
00:07:16,360 --> 00:07:18,000
It proves that I still have a chance.

156
00:07:19,120 --> 00:07:19,839
Brother

157
00:07:20,040 --> 00:07:21,439
I swear that

158
00:07:21,920 --> 00:07:24,519
from now on, if you have any confusion about love,

159
00:07:24,600 --> 00:07:26,040
I'll give you free consulting.

160
00:07:30,399 --> 00:07:31,639
It's not that I don't want to help you.

161
00:07:31,639 --> 00:07:32,560
As long as you don't object,

162
00:07:32,839 --> 00:07:34,160
I'll have my way.

163
00:07:34,680 --> 00:07:36,879
I can turn a blind eye.

164
00:07:36,920 --> 00:07:37,759
But

165
00:07:37,759 --> 00:07:39,360
if I hurt the Escort Agency again,

166
00:07:39,360 --> 00:07:40,480
I'll be damned.

167
00:07:40,480 --> 00:07:40,920
But

168
00:07:40,920 --> 00:07:42,279
if I fail to cherish Jia again,

169
00:07:42,279 --> 00:07:43,439
I'll die in a bad way.

170
00:07:43,439 --> 00:07:44,319
You...you...you let me go first.

171
00:07:44,639 --> 00:07:45,720
No, brother.

172
00:07:46,040 --> 00:07:46,879
Let go of me.

173
00:07:48,519 --> 00:07:49,319
But I can't carry

174
00:07:49,319 --> 00:07:50,759
so much wood back by myself.

175
00:08:16,240 --> 00:08:17,120
Why are you here?

176
00:08:18,360 --> 00:08:18,920
Jiao.

177
00:08:21,040 --> 00:08:21,600
Sit down.

178
00:08:22,279 --> 00:08:24,160
This little book stall has been so popular lately.

179
00:08:24,439 --> 00:08:26,759
And our neighbors are very enthusiastic.

180
00:08:26,959 --> 00:08:29,040
I suggest we open two more sessions, morning and evening.

181
00:08:29,120 --> 00:08:30,279
This way, it won't interfere with your schedule,

182
00:08:30,279 --> 00:08:31,759
and can also attract more customers.

183
00:08:32,720 --> 00:08:34,039
You're not answering my question.

184
00:08:34,080 --> 00:08:34,960
I'm asking you,

185
00:08:35,159 --> 00:08:37,679
why are you on my dinner table?

186
00:08:38,279 --> 00:08:39,360
Jiaojiao,

187
00:08:39,840 --> 00:08:41,840
how can you talk to the guest like this?

188
00:08:44,679 --> 00:08:45,399
Guest?

189
00:08:46,480 --> 00:08:49,200
He wants to open two sessions a day,

190
00:08:49,279 --> 00:08:51,000
how tired the back and forth journey is.

191
00:08:52,639 --> 00:08:53,480
So,

192
00:08:53,480 --> 00:08:55,559
I rent this guest room.

193
00:09:05,480 --> 00:09:06,039
No way.

194
00:09:06,919 --> 00:09:09,240
As the head of the Su's Escort Agency,

195
00:09:09,519 --> 00:09:10,720
I ask you to leave.

196
00:09:11,000 --> 00:09:12,559
You will get your rent back.

197
00:09:15,519 --> 00:09:17,279
I've been having bad luck

198
00:09:17,320 --> 00:09:18,960
playing cards recently.

199
00:09:19,679 --> 00:09:22,159
Mr. Wang next door has won all my pocket money

200
00:09:22,159 --> 00:09:23,279
in the past few months.

201
00:09:23,360 --> 00:09:24,919
Shi,

202
00:09:25,240 --> 00:09:27,519
take the money to your uncle later.

203
00:09:28,320 --> 00:09:28,879
Gong Xi,

204
00:09:29,279 --> 00:09:31,399
Have I paid off my debt to Huayue Tower?

205
00:09:34,799 --> 00:09:35,480
Qi,

206
00:09:37,080 --> 00:09:38,960
the escort vehicles and boxes are worn out.

207
00:09:39,120 --> 00:09:40,480
They need to be repaired before use.

208
00:09:49,240 --> 00:09:49,840
Grandpa,

209
00:09:50,600 --> 00:09:52,200
I have many new inventions recently.

210
00:09:52,879 --> 00:09:54,639
But I have no money to buy materials.

211
00:09:56,440 --> 00:09:57,240
Well,

212
00:10:00,080 --> 00:10:01,759
I don't think you collect rent,

213
00:10:02,159 --> 00:10:02,879
but drug.

214
00:10:21,080 --> 00:10:21,519
Eat up.

215
00:10:23,720 --> 00:10:24,200
Dad.

216
00:10:24,200 --> 00:10:25,159
Eat.

217
00:10:27,080 --> 00:10:27,639
Come on.

218
00:10:33,600 --> 00:10:34,440
I don't drink.

219
00:10:58,080 --> 00:10:58,840
I can't sleep.

220
00:10:59,200 --> 00:11:00,200
I want to go back to the Moon God Pavilion.

221
00:11:04,360 --> 00:11:05,320
I have a question for you.

222
00:11:06,639 --> 00:11:08,720
Between me and Meng Feifei, who do you choose?

223
00:11:10,480 --> 00:11:11,639
Between me and Mr. Su, who do you choose?

224
00:11:11,639 --> 00:11:12,519
I choose you.

225
00:11:14,240 --> 00:11:14,720
Come back.

226
00:11:15,120 --> 00:11:15,919
Where are you going?

227
00:11:16,440 --> 00:11:17,120
Back to the Moon God Pavilion.

228
00:11:17,720 --> 00:11:18,879
This agency can't hold me.

229
00:11:20,159 --> 00:11:21,519
Look at you.

230
00:11:21,879 --> 00:11:24,320
You can't stand a day without Meng Feifei.

231
00:11:25,919 --> 00:11:26,519
My Lord.

232
00:11:26,840 --> 00:11:28,080
Take a look at yourself first.

233
00:11:42,919 --> 00:11:43,639
Everyone's here.

234
00:11:44,320 --> 00:11:45,120
Eat.

235
00:11:48,320 --> 00:11:49,120
I'm exhausted.

236
00:11:52,200 --> 00:11:52,799
Jiao.

237
00:11:52,919 --> 00:11:53,399
Here.

238
00:11:55,360 --> 00:11:56,320
Will we have hot breakfast

239
00:11:56,440 --> 00:11:57,720
after morning exercises?

240
00:11:57,720 --> 00:11:58,120
Yes.

241
00:11:58,360 --> 00:11:59,480
Jiao will have it.

242
00:12:01,879 --> 00:12:02,759
What do you mean?

243
00:12:02,879 --> 00:12:04,279
Others may not have it.

244
00:12:04,480 --> 00:12:05,279
Burn the bridge

245
00:12:05,679 --> 00:12:06,279
after crossing it.

246
00:12:16,879 --> 00:12:17,480
Jiao.

247
00:12:20,279 --> 00:12:21,240
I know you can't take care of it.

248
00:12:21,320 --> 00:12:22,120
You take this food box.

249
00:12:22,919 --> 00:12:23,320
I...

250
00:12:23,360 --> 00:12:24,240
I'm sorry.

251
00:12:57,080 --> 00:12:58,080
What are they looking at?

252
00:12:58,519 --> 00:12:58,919
My Lord,

253
00:12:59,440 --> 00:13:00,559
the story the young man is telling

254
00:13:00,559 --> 00:13:02,080
is about a young man who spent a fortune

255
00:13:02,360 --> 00:13:04,080
on books to help a scholar pass the exam.

256
00:13:06,480 --> 00:13:07,279
My Lady,

257
00:13:07,679 --> 00:13:08,759
you've just been released from confinement.

258
00:13:09,080 --> 00:13:11,120
If the master and the young master know it,

259
00:13:14,279 --> 00:13:15,240
who is so stupid

260
00:13:15,559 --> 00:13:16,279
to make up stories?

261
00:13:21,120 --> 00:13:23,000
It seems that we can't hear the new chapter today.

262
00:13:23,360 --> 00:13:23,960
Go, go.

263
00:13:24,360 --> 00:13:24,919
Go, go.

264
00:13:43,960 --> 00:13:44,559
Cheng Qi,

265
00:13:45,200 --> 00:13:46,960
you could have gone further.

266
00:13:48,360 --> 00:13:49,720
It doesn't matter.

267
00:13:50,080 --> 00:13:52,039
As long as I can tell my stories,

268
00:13:52,120 --> 00:13:53,080
it's enough.

269
00:13:53,639 --> 00:13:54,919
Today's performance is over.

270
00:13:55,240 --> 00:13:56,080
Please come back

271
00:13:56,120 --> 00:13:57,000
early tomorrow.

272
00:14:01,279 --> 00:14:02,240
The official performance

273
00:14:02,360 --> 00:14:03,399
is being prepared.

274
00:14:04,039 --> 00:14:06,240
I can help you get a chance to perform.

275
00:14:09,039 --> 00:14:10,080
Thank you for your kindness.

276
00:14:11,679 --> 00:14:13,120
I'm sorry

277
00:14:13,240 --> 00:14:14,159
to let you come all this way.

278
00:14:15,159 --> 00:14:16,159
Cheng Qi,

279
00:14:16,440 --> 00:14:17,720
who do you think you are?

280
00:14:18,080 --> 00:14:19,279
How dare you be so ungrateful?

281
00:14:21,120 --> 00:14:22,399
I'm just a nobody,

282
00:14:22,679 --> 00:14:23,879
letting you down.

283
00:14:25,120 --> 00:14:25,799
Now,

284
00:14:26,799 --> 00:14:27,559
this script

285
00:14:28,159 --> 00:14:29,559
is the most important thing to me.

286
00:14:34,559 --> 00:14:35,919
This is the important thing?

287
00:14:37,759 --> 00:14:40,120
The top student of Xingyun Academy performing on the street

288
00:14:40,600 --> 00:14:42,519
is just to help Su Yuejiao protect the escort agency?

289
00:14:43,480 --> 00:14:44,600
What's wrong with performing on the street?

290
00:14:45,519 --> 00:14:47,639
Good words are wonderful everywhere.

291
00:14:49,480 --> 00:14:50,240
In your eyes,

292
00:14:50,759 --> 00:14:52,080
she's just a bodyguard.

293
00:14:52,840 --> 00:14:53,759
But in my eyes,

294
00:14:55,039 --> 00:14:56,440
she's my family for life.

295
00:15:02,240 --> 00:15:02,720
Miss Zhang,

296
00:15:03,879 --> 00:15:05,480
I'm no longer the leader of the Xingyun.

297
00:15:05,879 --> 00:15:06,440
I hope you

298
00:15:07,200 --> 00:15:08,799
won't make it hard for the escort agency and Jia anymore.

299
00:15:17,240 --> 00:15:17,879
Okay.

300
00:15:18,440 --> 00:15:20,200
Remember what you said today.

301
00:15:34,360 --> 00:15:35,600
What a tenant you are!

302
00:15:35,799 --> 00:15:36,879
You delayed the dinner of the whole family.

303
00:15:38,480 --> 00:15:39,159
Hurry up.

304
00:15:39,440 --> 00:15:41,000
You've been talking for so long. Aren't you hungry?

305
00:15:42,879 --> 00:15:43,399
Okay.

306
00:15:44,480 --> 00:15:45,039
Give it to me.

307
00:16:42,080 --> 00:16:43,279
Yummy, yummy.

308
00:16:51,840 --> 00:16:52,519
Gong Xi, Fa Cai. [*Happy Chinese New Year.]

309
00:16:53,120 --> 00:16:53,559
Here.

310
00:16:59,200 --> 00:17:00,120
Let me see.

311
00:17:01,440 --> 00:17:02,279
See it later.

312
00:17:02,759 --> 00:17:03,840
The boss will notice it.

313
00:17:07,319 --> 00:17:08,519
See it later, got it?

314
00:17:17,759 --> 00:17:18,559
What are you hiding?

315
00:17:31,960 --> 00:17:33,440
The top and the little escort.

316
00:17:34,319 --> 00:17:35,799
Face and the little escort.

317
00:17:36,359 --> 00:17:37,799
Life and the little escort.

318
00:17:39,200 --> 00:17:40,079
The scholar's answer

319
00:17:40,839 --> 00:17:42,319
has always been the little escort.

320
00:17:46,160 --> 00:17:48,440
Someone wants to use the scholar.

321
00:17:49,279 --> 00:17:50,759
He started the contest

322
00:17:51,519 --> 00:17:52,880
and framed the escort

323
00:17:53,640 --> 00:17:56,319
to threaten the scholar.

324
00:18:02,200 --> 00:18:03,599
The scholar was eager to save people,

325
00:18:03,720 --> 00:18:04,720
so he fell into the trap.

326
00:18:05,119 --> 00:18:06,519
He thought that he could stop the danger

327
00:18:06,599 --> 00:18:07,960
by pushing the escort away.

328
00:18:09,160 --> 00:18:09,960
But in the end,

329
00:18:10,440 --> 00:18:12,119
both of them were hurt.

330
00:18:25,440 --> 00:18:26,519
I told you to go back to the room,

331
00:18:26,519 --> 00:18:27,319
but you didn't listen.

332
00:18:27,720 --> 00:18:28,680
Now the boss is angry.

333
00:18:40,279 --> 00:18:42,319
What kind of mediocrity did Zhang Qijia find?

334
00:18:42,759 --> 00:18:45,079
It seems that they are all recommended by Mr. Ling.

335
00:18:45,200 --> 00:18:47,039
The works of the noble family

336
00:18:47,519 --> 00:18:48,799
are mediocre in rhetoric

337
00:18:48,920 --> 00:18:50,039
and hollow in content.

338
00:18:50,559 --> 00:18:52,680
They want to attend the speech meeting of the official.

339
00:18:54,160 --> 00:18:56,240
One Ling Feng is not enough,

340
00:18:56,680 --> 00:18:58,240
and they find these people to make up the number.

341
00:18:59,640 --> 00:19:00,559
I think,

342
00:19:01,079 --> 00:19:02,519
the meeting will eventually

343
00:19:02,880 --> 00:19:04,519
return to Cheng Qi.

344
00:19:06,160 --> 00:19:07,799
But didn't Cheng Qi

345
00:19:07,799 --> 00:19:09,480
start storytelling on the street?

346
00:19:09,720 --> 00:19:11,359
Will the official really use him?

347
00:19:11,720 --> 00:19:13,279
He just chooses to be a commoner,

348
00:19:13,559 --> 00:19:14,920
not lack of talent.

349
00:19:15,680 --> 00:19:17,759
He still has the potential to rise.

350
00:19:19,559 --> 00:19:20,279
This time,

351
00:19:20,440 --> 00:19:22,559
the first phase of the plan

352
00:19:22,759 --> 00:19:23,680
of the plan is successful.

353
00:19:24,359 --> 00:19:25,599
What should we do in the second stage?

354
00:19:26,680 --> 00:19:27,559
Propose.

355
00:19:29,279 --> 00:19:30,519
Isn't that the final stage?

356
00:19:30,839 --> 00:19:31,359
Tomorrow?

357
00:19:32,960 --> 00:19:34,240
Isn't it too risky?

358
00:19:34,799 --> 00:19:37,039
How about discussing it with Feifei?

359
00:19:37,559 --> 00:19:39,480
It was because of my hesitation before

360
00:19:39,680 --> 00:19:41,079
that led to all sorts of misunderstandings.

361
00:19:41,880 --> 00:19:42,559
This time,

362
00:19:43,079 --> 00:19:44,359
I'll be proactive and direct.

363
00:19:44,720 --> 00:19:45,440
If I fail,

364
00:19:45,640 --> 00:19:46,720
I'll try again.

365
00:19:49,839 --> 00:19:52,079
He said in front of everyone

366
00:19:52,079 --> 00:19:54,079
that you are his family.

367
00:19:55,039 --> 00:19:55,720
Wait.

368
00:19:55,920 --> 00:19:57,680
Cheng Qi moved into the agency.

369
00:19:57,680 --> 00:19:59,240
Su Yuqi didn't tell me.

370
00:19:59,240 --> 00:20:00,319
And you didn't tell me either.

371
00:20:00,319 --> 00:20:02,279
Do you even consider me family?

372
00:20:04,839 --> 00:20:06,680
I didn't let him move in.

373
00:20:07,079 --> 00:20:09,160
Then what's his scheme this time?

374
00:20:09,160 --> 00:20:11,680
You should have kicked him out.

375
00:20:15,160 --> 00:20:15,920
Xin,

376
00:20:16,559 --> 00:20:17,960
I think

377
00:20:18,400 --> 00:20:19,160
you're right.

378
00:20:19,960 --> 00:20:21,079
What did I say?

379
00:20:22,640 --> 00:20:25,279
The best way to forget someone

380
00:20:26,279 --> 00:20:28,039
is to find a new person to replace him.

381
00:20:28,960 --> 00:20:31,240
You finally figured it out.

382
00:20:32,720 --> 00:20:33,440
Wait.

383
00:20:33,759 --> 00:20:34,759
Did Cheng Qi

384
00:20:34,759 --> 00:20:36,480
do something wrong to you?

385
00:20:37,039 --> 00:20:38,240
No.

386
00:20:39,880 --> 00:20:43,319
Then you met someone better than him.

387
00:20:45,039 --> 00:20:45,640
No, no.

388
00:20:45,640 --> 00:20:46,440
That's impossible.

389
00:20:47,000 --> 00:20:48,920
Tell me what's going on now,

390
00:20:48,920 --> 00:20:49,759
or we'll break up.

391
00:20:51,839 --> 00:20:54,039
I'm afraid that

392
00:20:54,920 --> 00:20:55,759
I'll go back to him.

393
00:20:56,119 --> 00:20:56,880
No, no.

394
00:20:57,039 --> 00:20:57,839
Stop in time.

395
00:20:57,839 --> 00:20:58,720
It's never too late to turn back.

396
00:21:01,359 --> 00:21:01,960
Tell me,

397
00:21:02,519 --> 00:21:04,480
what kind of person are you looking for this time?

398
00:21:05,039 --> 00:21:07,319
I'll turn the whole city upside down

399
00:21:07,480 --> 00:21:08,480
to find a way for you.

400
00:21:09,240 --> 00:21:09,680
No need.

401
00:21:10,400 --> 00:21:12,119
I already have a suitable candidate.

402
00:21:13,880 --> 00:21:16,119
Is it another extraordinary person

403
00:21:16,119 --> 00:21:17,519
you met during your escort missions?

404
00:21:28,319 --> 00:21:28,920
How's that?

405
00:21:29,440 --> 00:21:29,920
Son-in-law,

406
00:21:30,119 --> 00:21:31,000
you'll do.

407
00:21:34,839 --> 00:21:36,440
If you're too nervous to speak later,

408
00:21:37,880 --> 00:21:39,279
just read this.

409
00:21:46,240 --> 00:21:47,279
Don't be afraid.

410
00:21:47,599 --> 00:21:49,000
She can't eat you.

411
00:21:57,720 --> 00:21:58,880
Since everyone is here,

412
00:21:59,079 --> 00:22:00,559
I have something to announce.

413
00:22:02,400 --> 00:22:04,039
I've been in charge for a while.

414
00:22:04,880 --> 00:22:05,759
I was too willful before

415
00:22:06,039 --> 00:22:07,359
and put the Escort Agency in danger.

416
00:22:07,640 --> 00:22:08,440
It was my fault.

417
00:22:09,440 --> 00:22:11,319
Now the Agency is back on track.

418
00:22:11,880 --> 00:22:13,039
It's time for me

419
00:22:13,240 --> 00:22:14,920
to find a helper

420
00:22:15,720 --> 00:22:16,839
for myself and the Escort Agency.

421
00:22:20,559 --> 00:22:22,160
So moving.

422
00:22:22,799 --> 00:22:23,519
Where's my pen?

423
00:22:23,720 --> 00:22:26,720
I don't have to read the book secretly.

424
00:22:33,599 --> 00:22:34,799
You finally forgive me.

425
00:22:34,920 --> 00:22:35,599
Jiao.

426
00:22:35,799 --> 00:22:36,680
My sister-in-law.

427
00:22:37,039 --> 00:22:37,680
Wait for me.

428
00:22:41,039 --> 00:22:42,240
Let me introduce him to you.

429
00:22:42,880 --> 00:22:43,680
This is Da Bao,

430
00:22:44,240 --> 00:22:45,200
the son of Zhen Yuwai.

431
00:22:45,680 --> 00:22:47,039
He's good at martial arts and well-behaved.

432
00:22:47,359 --> 00:22:48,759
He's a rare talent.

433
00:22:49,279 --> 00:22:51,039
Since he's the good match chosen by my uncle,

434
00:22:51,160 --> 00:22:52,279
and everyone knows him,

435
00:22:53,079 --> 00:22:53,799
I decide to

436
00:22:54,839 --> 00:22:55,799
get along with him.

437
00:22:58,559 --> 00:22:59,200
Nonsense!

438
00:23:02,759 --> 00:23:04,880
They are just swindlers who took money.

439
00:23:05,480 --> 00:23:06,000
Well,

440
00:23:06,160 --> 00:23:07,480
Since no one has any objections,

441
00:23:07,720 --> 00:23:10,039
we'll choose a day for the marriage.

442
00:23:15,079 --> 00:23:16,480
You!

443
00:23:18,000 --> 00:23:18,559
Dad,

444
00:23:19,240 --> 00:23:21,079
I really had nothing to do with this.

445
00:23:22,839 --> 00:23:23,440
Bao,

446
00:23:23,880 --> 00:23:25,240
who bought you candy?

447
00:23:25,279 --> 00:23:26,319
It's my sister.

448
00:23:27,440 --> 00:23:27,880
Bao,

449
00:23:28,519 --> 00:23:28,920
is it sweet?

450
00:23:29,319 --> 00:23:31,440
Yes, as sweet as my sister.

451
00:23:33,079 --> 00:23:35,079
My Lord, did you eat something wrong?

452
00:23:35,079 --> 00:23:36,440
Or are you drunk?

453
00:23:36,559 --> 00:23:37,119
Gao Jiao

454
00:23:37,960 --> 00:23:39,559
I don't believe you really want to marry him.

455
00:23:40,319 --> 00:23:41,599
Since I have taken over the position,

456
00:23:41,880 --> 00:23:44,039
I must take responsibility for the Escort Agency.

457
00:23:44,160 --> 00:23:46,359
It's my mother's tradition to find a husband to escort.

458
00:23:46,720 --> 00:23:48,119
Dabao's Kung Fu is so cute.

459
00:23:48,119 --> 00:23:48,759
And he's obedient.

460
00:23:49,079 --> 00:23:49,920
What's wrong with him?

461
00:23:50,680 --> 00:23:51,720
I'm cute, too.

462
00:23:51,720 --> 00:23:52,880
I can also obey you.

463
00:23:53,519 --> 00:23:53,920
How about this?

464
00:23:54,160 --> 00:23:55,160
Let me compete with him.

465
00:23:55,319 --> 00:23:56,440
If I win,

466
00:23:56,440 --> 00:23:57,119
you let him go,

467
00:23:57,119 --> 00:23:58,039
and I'll marry you.

468
00:23:58,119 --> 00:23:58,599
No way.

469
00:24:01,400 --> 00:24:02,720
I think it's okay.

470
00:24:07,799 --> 00:24:08,559
Jiaojiao,

471
00:24:09,279 --> 00:24:10,839
you may have forgotten.

472
00:24:11,079 --> 00:24:13,119
When Dabao wanted to marry into the family,

473
00:24:13,240 --> 00:24:14,960
he proposed a duel with Cheng Qi.

474
00:24:15,000 --> 00:24:16,680
We agreed.

475
00:24:17,160 --> 00:24:19,880
Now Cheng Qi wants to duel with Dabao.

476
00:24:20,200 --> 00:24:21,839
We should also...

477
00:24:25,440 --> 00:24:26,359
Then let them duel.

478
00:24:27,440 --> 00:24:28,240
Okay.

479
00:24:29,119 --> 00:24:29,720
Jiaojiao,

480
00:24:30,960 --> 00:24:32,440
Cheng Qi knows no martial arts.

481
00:24:33,000 --> 00:24:33,720
If they duel,

482
00:24:33,920 --> 00:24:34,880
he's bound to lose.

483
00:24:38,519 --> 00:24:39,640
I was late last time.

484
00:24:40,480 --> 00:24:41,000
This time,

485
00:24:41,319 --> 00:24:43,000
I'll win him fairly.

486
00:24:44,759 --> 00:24:45,279
Jiaojiao,

487
00:24:46,000 --> 00:24:46,720
I'm determined

488
00:24:47,160 --> 00:24:47,960
to marry you.

489
00:25:00,440 --> 00:25:01,519
What are you thinking?

490
00:25:01,880 --> 00:25:03,039
Compete with Zhen Dabao?

491
00:25:03,519 --> 00:25:04,400
Yeah, my son-in-law.

492
00:25:04,720 --> 00:25:06,200
Even I'm afraid of his fists.

493
00:25:06,440 --> 00:25:08,200
If you can withstand a punch, you're lucky.

494
00:25:08,880 --> 00:25:09,920
I think you'd better give up.

495
00:25:10,359 --> 00:25:12,200
Jiaojiao may not really want to marry him.

496
00:25:12,480 --> 00:25:13,680
Maybe she just wants to make you mad,

497
00:25:13,839 --> 00:25:14,839
and give up.

498
00:25:18,319 --> 00:25:19,400
I don't care.

499
00:25:20,079 --> 00:25:22,119
My grandpa set the date for five days later.

500
00:25:22,359 --> 00:25:24,119
I must find a way to beat him in these five days.

501
00:25:25,039 --> 00:25:26,440
Why don't you listen to me?

502
00:25:26,799 --> 00:25:27,799
What can you do in five days?

503
00:25:29,160 --> 00:25:30,680
Let Daqi make you a suit of armor.

504
00:25:31,119 --> 00:25:32,119
You just go to be beaten.

505
00:25:32,519 --> 00:25:33,920
You'll be so heavy that you can't run.

506
00:25:34,000 --> 00:25:34,839
Stand there and take a beating?

507
00:25:35,279 --> 00:25:36,039
I think

508
00:25:36,319 --> 00:25:37,279
you'd better buy some candies.

509
00:25:37,440 --> 00:25:38,799
Use candies as weapons.

510
00:25:45,039 --> 00:25:46,079
Time waits for no man.

511
00:25:46,319 --> 00:25:47,160
Why don't you

512
00:25:47,319 --> 00:25:48,519
teach him kung fu first

513
00:25:48,839 --> 00:25:49,559
and think about

514
00:25:49,640 --> 00:25:50,920
winning by ingenuity?

515
00:25:52,240 --> 00:25:53,079
That's all we can do.

516
00:25:53,359 --> 00:25:54,400
We can't let Jiaojiao make trouble.

517
00:25:55,160 --> 00:25:55,559
Uncle,

518
00:25:56,039 --> 00:25:57,799
I'll leave escorting to you these days.

519
00:25:59,839 --> 00:26:01,759
Start special training tomorrow.

520
00:27:27,720 --> 00:27:28,559
My back!

521
00:27:28,680 --> 00:27:29,359
My back!

522
00:27:30,960 --> 00:27:32,920
This is as fast and strong as I can get.

523
00:27:33,119 --> 00:27:34,680
At least it's an improvement.

524
00:27:35,720 --> 00:27:37,079
Today's special training

525
00:27:37,440 --> 00:27:38,599
is the most important part.

526
00:27:39,440 --> 00:27:40,079
getting hit.

527
00:27:41,720 --> 00:27:42,279
Remember,

528
00:27:42,799 --> 00:27:43,599
don't move later.

529
00:27:44,319 --> 00:27:45,240
Feel the force,

530
00:27:45,559 --> 00:27:46,279
neutralize it,

531
00:27:46,880 --> 00:27:48,519
and wear down your opponent's strength

532
00:27:49,000 --> 00:27:49,880
and patience.

533
00:28:11,759 --> 00:28:13,319
Learn to rely on protection to dissipate force.

534
00:28:15,440 --> 00:28:16,799
Only then will you have the chance to wear down the opponent.

535
00:28:19,200 --> 00:28:19,960
To feel the force,

536
00:28:20,279 --> 00:28:20,960
and to resolve the force.

537
00:29:06,880 --> 00:29:09,240
It's just a story to fool girls.

538
00:29:09,279 --> 00:29:10,480
It's not that exaggerated.

539
00:29:10,960 --> 00:29:11,880
You don't understand.

540
00:29:12,200 --> 00:29:13,680
Other stories are made up.

541
00:29:14,279 --> 00:29:15,319
His is different.

542
00:29:17,240 --> 00:29:18,200
He made it up.

543
00:29:19,519 --> 00:29:20,480
What?

544
00:29:20,680 --> 00:29:23,680
Watching you training in the training ground,

545
00:29:24,200 --> 00:29:26,000
