546
00:29:26,440 --> 00:29:27,640
He never got up.

547
00:29:28,079 --> 00:29:29,039
That was before.

548
00:29:29,480 --> 00:29:30,480
Now it's different.

549
00:29:33,279 --> 00:29:34,759
It's a pity that there's only half a book.

550
00:29:34,960 --> 00:29:36,759
I don't know what he wrote later.

551
00:29:37,880 --> 00:29:39,319
Will he write me in?

552
00:29:47,240 --> 00:29:48,880
Which is more important, this book

553
00:29:48,880 --> 00:29:50,519
or Yikeba's movements?

554
00:29:52,559 --> 00:29:54,240
You've been in his camp for so long.

555
00:29:54,359 --> 00:29:56,759
You just drink every day.

556
00:29:57,000 --> 00:29:59,240
He won't take you out for about another half month.

557
00:30:00,519 --> 00:30:01,799
Yesterday, when drinking,

558
00:30:02,440 --> 00:30:03,519
