559
00:30:04,759 --> 00:30:05,920
The one who patrols the border?

560
00:30:07,240 --> 00:30:07,799
No.

561
00:30:08,400 --> 00:30:10,000
The one in charge of supplies.

562
00:30:10,680 --> 00:30:11,759
That's strange.

563
00:30:12,160 --> 00:30:13,680
There's no relocation plan,

564
00:30:13,880 --> 00:30:15,279
and it's not time for a supply run.

565
00:30:15,359 --> 00:30:16,680
But he's going out for several days.

566
00:30:17,640 --> 00:30:19,240
He must be transporting something.

567
00:30:20,880 --> 00:30:22,480
I sent the men Jalur found for me

568
00:30:22,480 --> 00:30:23,640
to tail him.

569
00:30:24,279 --> 00:30:25,359
You have to find a reason

570
00:30:25,400 --> 00:30:26,759
to let me leave the barracks for a few days.

571
00:30:28,079 --> 00:30:29,240
It's easy.

572
00:30:29,440 --> 00:30:32,119
Just say I want you to accompany me for a few days.

573
00:30:32,720 --> 00:30:35,880
Learn from these scripts to deceive young girls.

574
00:30:36,880 --> 00:30:37,960
Change one.

575
00:30:37,960 --> 00:30:39,960
I like this one.

576
00:30:53,640 --> 00:30:54,440
